items.RS_Ammo_Wayfinder.name = Wayfinder Cartridges
items.RS_Ammo_Wayfinder.description = Copper jackets and a hard iron point, made for a surveyor's first clean shot.\nFits Wildwood Surveyor only. Ammo impact: +6 body / +9 head. Loaded normal shot: 22 / 33 before modifiers.\nVelocity 100 blocks/s | Drop rating 6 | Nominal travel 100 blocks. Craft 32 per batch; one round per normal shot.
items.RS_Ammo_Sirocco.name = Sirocco Longshot Rounds
items.RS_Ammo_Sirocco.description = Thorium-stabilized long rounds sealed against grit. A yellow crystal primer keeps the desert charge consistent.\nFits Dunewatch Longshot only. Ammo impact: +10 body / +15 head. Loaded normal shot: 30 / 45 before modifiers.\nVelocity 125 blocks/s | Drop rating 4 | Nominal travel 125 blocks. Craft 32 per batch; one round per normal shot.
items.RS_Ammo_Rimeglass.name = Rimeglass Match Rounds
items.RS_Ammo_Rimeglass.description = Cold-worked cobalt and silver seat a finely cut match tip for the Whisperfrost watch.\nFits Frostline Sentinel only. Ammo impact: +12 body / +18 head. Loaded normal shot: 42 / 63 before modifiers.\nVelocity 150 blocks/s | Drop rating 3 | Nominal travel 150 blocks. Craft 32 per batch; one round per normal shot.
items.RS_Ammo_Gravelight.name = Gravelight Reliquary Rounds
items.RS_Ammo_Gravelight.description = Bone spacers cradle a purple focus inside a dark iron case. The dead halls taught its makers to waste neither lead nor breath.\nFits Mournhollow Epitaph only. Ammo impact: +16 body / +24 head. Loaded normal shot: 56 / 84 before modifiers.\nVelocity 200 blocks/s | Drop rating 1 | Nominal travel 175 blocks. Craft 24 per batch; one round per normal shot.
items.RS_Ammo_SiegeSlug.name = Gobliterator Siege Slugs
items.RS_Ammo_SiegeSlug.description = A solid metal penetrator rides an amber induction coil. Deepworks scrap turns the Gobliterator's own machinery into its final ammunition.\nFits Gobliterator's Requiem only. Ammo impact: +18 body / +23 head. Loaded normal shot: 78 / 98 before modifiers.\nVelocity 260 blocks/s | Drop rating 0 | Nominal travel 160 blocks. Craft 16 per batch; one round per normal shot. Special shots use two rounds and the weapon's listed special damage.
items.RS_Ammo_Firstlight.name = Firstlight Prism Cartridges
items.RS_Ammo_Firstlight.description = A white-gold cartridge encloses a violet prism and a cyan focusing lens: a measured charge for the last light of Luminia.\nFits Dawnpiercer, Last Light of Luminia only. Ammo impact: +12 body / +30 head. Loaded normal shot: 52 / 130 before modifiers.\nVelocity 300 blocks/s | Drop rating 0 | Nominal travel 225 blocks. Craft 16 per batch; one round per normal shot. Special shots use two rounds and the weapon's listed special damage.
items.RS_Ammo_Penance.name = Penance Rounds
items.RS_Ammo_Penance.description = Dark silver braces a split metal point around an altar eye. A pinch of Moon Salt steadies the charge.\nFits Malediction, the Unblinking Eye only. Ammo impact: +18 body / +27 head. Loaded normal shot: 56 / 84 before modifiers.\nVelocity 200 blocks/s | Drop rating 1 | Nominal travel 175 blocks. Craft 16 per batch; one round per normal shot.
items.RS_Ammo_Threadline.name = Threadline Sabots
items.RS_Ammo_Threadline.description = Fullmetal plates brace a cyan crystal core, the casing etched with a path through a maze.\nFits Labyrinth Threadkeeper only. Ammo impact: +20 body / +30 head. Loaded normal shot: 58 / 87 before modifiers.\nVelocity 220 blocks/s | Drop rating 1 | Nominal travel 185 blocks. Craft 24 per batch; one round per normal shot.
items.RS_Ammo_Skyglass.name = Skyglass Scout Cartridges
items.RS_Ammo_Skyglass.description = Blue crystal, copper and iron bound in red for an old sky-trader's rifle. A small green seal marks the rounds that passed the wind test.\nFits Skybound Farwatch only. Ammo impact: +10 body / +15 head. Loaded normal shot: 40 / 60 before modifiers.\nVelocity 150 blocks/s | Drop rating 3 | Nominal travel 150 blocks. Craft 32 per batch; one round per normal shot.
items.RS_Ammo_Cartridge.name = Ranger Cartridge (Legacy)
items.RS_Ammo_Cartridge.description = Legacy stock. Repack 1:1 at the Gunsmith's Bench into Wayfinder Cartridges, Sirocco Longshot Rounds, Rimeglass Match Rounds, Skyglass Scout Cartridges. New rifles require their named cartridges.
items.RS_Ammo_ChargedCartridge.name = Charged Ranger Cartridge (Legacy)
items.RS_Ammo_ChargedCartridge.description = Legacy stock. Repack 1:1 at the Gunsmith's Bench into Gravelight Reliquary Rounds, Penance Rounds, Threadline Sabots. New rifles require their named cartridges.
items.RS_Ammo_EnergyCell.name = Ranger Energy Cell (Legacy)
items.RS_Ammo_EnergyCell.description = Legacy stock. Repack 1:1 at the Gunsmith's Bench into Gobliterator Siege Slugs, Firstlight Prism Cartridges. New rifles require their named cartridges.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Wildwood_Surveyor.name = Wildwood Surveyor
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Wildwood_Surveyor.description = Oak and copper built for the quiet paths of the Emerald Wilds. One steady breath, one clean shot.\nLoaded normal shot: 22 body / 33 head before modifiers. Rifle 16/24 + ammo 6/9. 2.8s cycle | 4x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Wayfinder Cartridges (one per shot).\nF: reload 1 round(s) in 2.3s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 88.0% at the 100-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Dunewatch_Longshot.name = Dunewatch Longshot
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Dunewatch_Longshot.description = A sand-sealed long rifle assembled for the watchposts of the Howling Sands. The horizon is closer than it looks.\nLoaded normal shot: 30 body / 45 head before modifiers. Rifle 20/30 + ammo 10/15. 2.8s cycle | 6x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Sirocco Longshot Rounds (one per shot).\nF: reload 1 round(s) in 2.5s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 83.4% at the 125-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Frostline_Sentinel.name = Frostline Sentinel
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Frostline_Sentinel.description = Silver-lined cobalt keeps this sentinel true through Whisperfrost's bitter winds. Its pale tracer cuts through the snowfall.\nLoaded normal shot: 42 body / 63 head before modifiers. Rifle 30/45 + ammo 12/18. 3s cycle | 8x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Rimeglass Match Rounds (one per shot).\nF: reload 1 round(s) in 2.7s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 78.8% at the 150-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Mournhollow_Epitaph.name = Mournhollow Epitaph
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Mournhollow_Epitaph.description = A reliquary key reforged into a violet focusing chamber. Below Mournhollow, every echo deserves a final word.\nLoaded normal shot: 56 body / 84 head before modifiers. Rifle 40/60 + ammo 16/24. 3.1s cycle | 8x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Gravelight Reliquary Rounds (one per shot).\nF: reload 1 round(s) in 2.85s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 74.2% at the 175-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Deepworks_Railspike.name = Gobliterator's Requiem
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Deepworks_Railspike.description = Recovered from the wreck of the Gobliterator, this rifle carries a heart that has forgotten how to stop. Deepworks artificers meant its rail chamber to shatter gates. A patient marksman taught it a quieter purpose. Amber coils kindle around a cyan rail, the scope settles, and the stolen core begins its last hymn. Then comes a single iron verdict, followed by a long, rattling breath while the chamber cools. The last sound of the Deepworks belongs to whoever holds this weapon.\nLoaded normal shot: 78 body / 98 head before modifiers. Rifle 60/75 + ammo 18/23. 2.9s cycle | 6x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Gobliterator Siege Slugs (one per shot).\nF: reload 2 round(s) in 2.7s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 77.0% at the 160-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.\nReactor Break: Hold Q 1s; 120/150 damage, 0.5s NPC stagger. Costs 2 matching rounds. 12s shared special cooldown; 5.5s firing recovery.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Luminia_Dawnpiercer.name = Dawnpiercer, Last Light of Luminia
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Luminia_Dawnpiercer.description = Three shattered seals sleep within a lattice of Prisma. When their fragments align, white-gold runes awaken along the stock and a violet star gathers behind the lens. Luminian wardens are said to have carried such lights when the sanctums fell silent, saving each brilliant shot for the shape at the far end of the dark. This remnant answers the same oath: hold fast, choose the moment, and let a single ray speak. Between shots, its crystal hums like dawn remembered beneath stone.\nLoaded normal shot: 52 body / 130 head before modifiers. Rifle 40/100 + ammo 12/30. 2.9s cycle | 10x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Firstlight Prism Cartridges (one per shot).\nF: reload 2 round(s) in 2.7s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 65.0% at the 225-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.\nRadiant Brand: Press Q; 30/45 damage, marks for 6s and slows eligible NPCs 20% for 4s. Costs 2 matching rounds. 12s shared special cooldown; 2.9s firing recovery.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Nameless_Covenant.name = Malediction, the Unblinking Eye
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Nameless_Covenant.description = A dark-silver covenant struck at the Nameless God's altar. The caged eye holds its gaze until the chamber falls silent.\nLoaded normal shot: 56 body / 84 head before modifiers. Rifle 38/57 + ammo 18/27. 3.1s cycle | 8x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Penance Rounds (one per shot).\nF: reload 1 round(s) in 2.85s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 74.2% at the 175-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.\nSold exclusively through The Nameless God's Barter: Weapons, Tier 2. Price: 40 Dark Coins + 1 Silver Skull.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Labyrinth_Threadkeeper.name = Labyrinth Threadkeeper
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Labyrinth_Threadkeeper.description = Chrome ribs guard a cyan thread through the Labyrinth's black halls. Trace the line, hold your breath, and make the way clear.\nLoaded normal shot: 58 body / 87 head before modifiers. Rifle 38/57 + ammo 20/30. 3.2s cycle | 8x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Threadline Sabots (one per shot).\nF: reload 1 round(s) in 2.95s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 72.4% at the 185-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Skybound_Farwatch.name = Skybound Farwatch
items.Weapon_Crossbow_Skybound_Farwatch.description = Darkwood, red bindings, and blue steel from a wandering sky trader. An old green carving watches over every distant trail.\nLoaded normal shot: 40 body / 60 head before modifiers. Rifle 30/45 + ammo 10/15. 3s cycle | 6x scope.\nHold secondary to aim; click primary once to fire. Uses Skyglass Scout Cartridges (one per shot).\nF: reload 1 round(s) in 2.6s. Matching ammo transfers only when reloading finishes.\nDistance: full base damage through 35 blocks, then gradual falloff; about 78.8% at the 150-block nominal travel limit. Uses actual projectile path.

