items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Trailwarden.name = Wildwood Trailwarden
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Trailwarden.description = Oak panels and peened copper recall the Emerald Wilds' trail stations. Its maker cut a fresh notch for every traveler brought home. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots.\n8/12 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.78s cycle; 8 rounds; F reload 1.65s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Waytrail Pistol Cartridges. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 45 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Sandbound_Oath.name = Dunewatch Sandbound Oath
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Sandbound_Oath.description = Sand-colored wraps cover a thorium-sealed action. In the Howling Sands, the watch keeps its oath long after its banners disappear beneath the dunes. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots.\n11/17 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.78s cycle; 8 rounds; F reload 1.7s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Sirocco Pistol Cartridges. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 52 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Pale_Marshal.name = Frostline Pale Marshal
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Pale_Marshal.description = Silver tracery runs through cold-worked cobalt. Whisperfrost wardens kept this pattern beside the hearth, ready when the white fields moved. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots.\n15/23 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.82s cycle; 9 rounds; F reload 1.8s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Rimeglass Pistol Cartridges. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 62 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Last_Confession.name = Mournhollow Last Confession
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Last_Confession.description = A Mournhollow reliquary key seats behind a violet chamber. Its inscriptions are names, each left unfinished until the living return. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots.\n20/30 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.85s cycle; 8 rounds; F reload 1.95s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Gravelight Pistol Cartridges. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 70 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Gutter_Saint.name = Gutter Saint, Mercy of the Deepworks
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Gutter_Saint.description = The Gobliterator's broken heart turns within an amber lattice. Deepworks smiths listened to the wreckage and forged its stubborn rhythm into a weapon. Cyan rails flare between battered iron ribs; every discharge is followed by the scrape and sigh of machinery forced to remember its purpose. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots.\n27/34 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.9s cycle; 8 rounds; F reload 2.1s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Cindercoil Handgun Cells. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 65 blocks.\nQ — Absolution Hammer: 42/53 body/head, costs 2 rounds; 12s shared special cooldown; 2.52s recovery. Hold Q for 0.35s to fire one focused shot; eligible NPCs stagger for 0.2s. Freeze immunity and enraged interrupt immunity prevent the stagger. The shot commits two loaded rounds and locks firing for 2.52s. Releasing before the charge completes cancels without spending rounds or starting the special cooldown.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Vesper.name = Vesper, the Dawn Unspent
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Vesper.description = Three fragments of Luminia's fallen seals lie aligned within a pale prism. White-gold channels awake around a violet star, casting the small light once kept above the sanctum doors. Its bearer inherits an unfinished vigil: guide the faithful through the dark, and spend the dawn with care. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots.\n18/45 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.9s cycle; 8 rounds; F reload 2.1s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Vesperglass Handgun Cells. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 90 blocks.\nQ — Evening Benediction: 10/18 body/head, costs 2 rounds; 12s shared special cooldown; 1.6s recovery. Press Q for a low-damage setup shot that visibly marks NPCs for 8s and slows eligible NPCs by 10% for 2s. Slow-immune NPCs retain only the visual mark. The shot commits two loaded rounds and locks firing for 1.6s.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Absolver.name = Black Sacrament
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Absolver.description = Dark silver and a silver skull frame the Nameless God's compact covenant. A red oath-mark hides beneath each violet-lit plate; no maker's name survives. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots. Sold exclusively through The Nameless God's Barter: Weapons, Tier 2.\n19/30 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.87s cycle; 7 rounds; F reload 1.9s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Penance Pistol Cartridges. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 62 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Quiet_Equation.name = Labyrinth Quiet Equation
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Quiet_Equation.description = Fullmetal ribs bind a cyan focus in a measured lattice. Labyrinth artificers left one thread unclosed, an invitation to find the next way through. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots.\n21/32 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.95s cycle; 10 rounds; F reload 2.05s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Threadline Pistol Cartridges. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 78 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Windward_Promise.name = Skybound Windward Promise
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_Handgun_Windward_Promise.description = Windworn brass guards sky-blue steel and a green sight-stone. The Airshop's couriers prefer a light pack and one promise kept above the clouds. Mobile close-to-mid-range sidearm with measured follow-up shots.\n14/24 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.78s cycle; 8 rounds; F reload 1.7s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Skyglass Pistol Cartridges. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 14 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 35% at 90. Nominal travel limit 68 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SMG_Brushfire.name = Wildwood Brushfire
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SMG_Brushfire.description = Oak panels and peened copper recall the Emerald Wilds' trail stations. Its maker cut a fresh notch for every traveler brought home. Short-range automatic pressure; steep travel falloff and frequent reloads.\n2.5/3.5 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.22s cycle; 20 rounds; F reload 2.2s.\nHold primary for automatic fire; secondary aims. Uses only Waytrail Compact Rounds. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 10 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 25% at 72. Nominal travel limit 35 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SMG_Dust_Choir.name = Dunewatch Dust Choir
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SMG_Dust_Choir.description = Sand-colored wraps cover a thorium-sealed action. In the Howling Sands, the watch keeps its oath long after its banners disappear beneath the dunes. Short-range automatic pressure; steep travel falloff and frequent reloads.\n3.5/5 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.22s cycle; 22 rounds; F reload 2.3s.\nHold primary for automatic fire; secondary aims. Uses only Sirocco Compact Rounds. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 10 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 25% at 72. Nominal travel limit 42 blocks.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SMG_Sleetweaver.name = Frostline Sleetweaver
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SMG_Sleetweaver.description = Silver tracery runs through cold-worked cobalt. Whisperfrost wardens kept this pattern beside the hearth, ready when the white fields moved. Short-range automatic pressure; steep travel falloff and frequent reloads.\n4.5/6.5 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.23s cycle; 24 rounds; F reload 2.4s.\nHold primary for automatic fire; secondary aims. Uses only Rimeglass Compact Rounds. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 10 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 25% at 72. Nominal travel limit 48 blocks.
