items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SMG_Many_Whispers.description = Dark silver and a silver skull frame the Nameless God's compact covenant. A red oath-mark hides beneath each violet-lit plate; no maker's name survives. Short-range automatic pressure; steep travel falloff and frequent reloads. Sold exclusively through The Nameless God's Barter: Weapons, Tier 2.\n5.75/8.5 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 0.24s cycle; 24 rounds; F reload 2.65s.\nHold primary for automatic fire; secondary aims. Uses only Penance Compact Rounds. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 10 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 25% at 72. Nominal travel limit 52 blocks.
