items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SemiAuto_Iron_Testament.name = Iron Testament, Voice of the Deepworks
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SemiAuto_Iron_Testament.description = The Gobliterator's broken heart turns within an amber lattice. Deepworks smiths listened to the wreckage and forged its stubborn rhythm into a weapon. Cyan rails flare between battered iron ribs; every discharge is followed by the scrape and sigh of machinery forced to remember its purpose. Deliberate precision follow-ups between a sidearm and a bolt-action sniper.\n34/43 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 1.25s cycle; 8 rounds; F reload 2.9s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Cindercoil Marksman Cells. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 25 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 50% at 175. Nominal travel limit 120 blocks.\nQ — Iron Verdict: 54/68 body/head, costs 2 rounds; 12s shared special cooldown; 3.5s recovery. Hold Q for 1.1s to fire one focused shot; eligible NPCs stagger for 0.5s. Freeze immunity and enraged interrupt immunity prevent the stagger. The shot commits two loaded rounds and locks firing for 3.5s. Releasing before the charge completes cancels without spending rounds or starting the special cooldown.
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SemiAuto_Auroras_Witness.name = Aurora's Witness, Oath of Luminia
items.Weapon_Crossbow_AS_SemiAuto_Auroras_Witness.description = Three fragments of Luminia's fallen seals lie aligned within a pale prism. White-gold channels awake around a violet star, casting the small light once kept above the sanctum doors. Its bearer inherits an unfinished vigil: guide the faithful through the dark, and spend the dawn with care. Deliberate precision follow-ups between a sidearm and a bolt-action sniper.\n23/59 body/head before class, enchantments and armor. 1.25s cycle; 8 rounds; F reload 2.9s.\nClick primary once per shot; secondary aims. Uses only Vesperglass Marksman Cells. Ammo transfers at reload completion.\nFull base damage through 25 blocks of actual projectile travel, falling to 50% at 175. Nominal travel limit 175 blocks.\nQ — Witness Mark: 15/25 body/head, costs 2 rounds; 12s shared special cooldown; 1.875s recovery. Press Q for a low-damage setup shot that visibly marks NPCs for 8s and slows eligible NPCs by 10% for 5s. Slow-immune NPCs retain only the visual mark. The shot commits two loaded rounds and locks firing for 1.875s.
